Routal
Licensed under the Mozilla Public License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

Routal is designed to run on Talos Linux (https://github.com/siderolabs/talos,
Copyright (c) Sidero Labs, Inc., MPL-2.0). It does not include Talos source code;
the earlier fork is kept, with its original headers, in the `talos-fork` branch.

The extension image bundles Alpine Linux packages, notably nftables (GPL-2.0) and
its libraries, unmodified. Their sources are available from https://pkgs.alpinelinux.org
and https://netfilter.org.
